# 统一行尾，避免跨机器协作时把脚本改坏
# 规则：仓库内一律存 LF；只在检出到 Windows 时把批处理换成 CRLF。

# 默认：交给 git 判断文本/二进制，文本统一存 LF
* text=auto

# ---- Windows 批处理：必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析 goto/label 会出错 ----
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ---- Unix shell 脚本：必须是 LF，CRLF 会让 sh 直接报错 ----
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
.workbuddy/skills/taptap-maker/bin/run-node      text eol=lf
.workbuddy/skills/taptap-maker/bin/taptap-maker  text eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换 ----
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.svg  text
*.zip  binary
*.gguf binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.pyd  binary

# ---- 语言统计：把技能目录和整合包产物排除，免得 stats 被第三方代码淹没 ----
.workbuddy/skills/** linguist-vendored
dist/**              linguist-generated
